340 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Tim\240described the Super Bowl homepage campaign\072 all energy went into a short\055term spike with uncertain value\056 \n\nHe had to anchor the team in long\055term strategic relevance amid the urgency\056 He did the emotional labor of contextualizing against short\055term pressure\013\n\nWhat if an AI could\031ve somehow reinforced that in a different situation\077)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 341 0 R
     /Pg 328 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
