342 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Akhil\240talked about short\055term decisions that undermined long\055term scalability\056 \n\nOne example\072 \050while talking about an acquisition\051 customizing early deals that later broke the model\056 \n\nAn AI prompting\054 \034Does this decision reinforce your 5\055year architecture\054 or just solve this quarter\031s fire\077\035 could help put courage in tension with short\055term incentive structures\013)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 343 0 R
     /Pg 328 0 R
